\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Dlr Gets Brief Respite Vs Majors Pre-Holiday \b0\par\par\uc2  By Miyako Takebe \par \uc2 501 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Mai 2003\par 07:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par \par \uc2  TOKYO -(Dow Jones)- Downward pressure on the dollar let up temporarily ahead of Japan's three-day weekend, helping it remain within established trading ranges against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Asia Friday. \par \par \uc2  "Given all the excitement in New York overnight, Tokyo players were at a loss as to how to play the market today, especially with the weekend approaching," said Minoru Shioiri, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at Mitsubishi Securities. Tokyo markets will be closed Monday for a national holiday. \par \par \uc2  While most market players see room for more dollar weakness down the line, Friday's slight pause in dollar selling kept the euro trading quietly below $1.1250 for the Asian session, preventing a repeat performance of the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's overnight leap to fresh four-year highs above $1.1280. \par \par \uc2  The dollar managed to regain some lost ground against the yen on profit taking and on U.S. President George W. Bush's speech officially declaring that "major combat \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Iraq have ended." \par \par \uc2  But the reaction on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to the speech was extremely small and overall dollar/yen movements remained sluggish given the market's general lack of interest in buying the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  "The yen's not immune from the current weak-dollar trend, but there's no reason to actively buy the yen either," said Mitsubishi's Shioiri, citing rock-bottom Japanese interest rates, dismal Japanese economic fundamentals and fears that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Finance Ministry will quietly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the yen from rising too far. \par \par \uc2  Rather, Japanese investors are shifting their focus to higher-yielding \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  like the Australian and Canadian dollar, which have continued to post strong gains against the yen, as well as the greenback, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "Funds are flowing to \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  with high yields as investors' risk appetites are recovering," said Satoshi Tate, vice president of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at UFJ Bank. \par \par \uc2  The Australian dollar jumped some 30 sen against the yen Friday morning to a peak of Y75.32, its highest level against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in three and a half years. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will likely continue posting gains given that it's likely the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will keep interest rates steady and that the Australian economy is likely to outperform the sluggish world economy. \par \par \uc2  The Canadian dollar also continued to rack up gains against the yen, rising to Y83.72, its strongest level in just over a year. \par \par \uc2  At 0515 GMT, the dollar was quoted at Y118.78, above Y118.55 late Thursday in New York. The dollar was at Y118.75 late Thursday in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  The euro was at $1.1238, little changed from $1.1239 late Thursday in New York. The euro was at $1.1196 in Tokyo Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Against the yen, the euro was quoted at Y133.48, up from Y133.24 in New York late Thursday. The euro was at Y132.95 in Tokyo late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  1074 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030502dz520009c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
