\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar slips, nervous as troops near Baghdad. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Hideyuki Sano \par \uc2 578 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 April 2003\par 05:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, April 3 (Reuters) - The dollar backed off in Asia on Thursday as initial euphoria over the latest advance by U.S.-led forces to the outskirts of Baghdad waned in a market constantly looking over its shoulder for the next development in the Iraq war. \par \par \uc2  The dollar had soared against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday when the fast pace of the march towards the Iraqi capital suggested to some players that the war could end soon. \par \par \uc2  But others are concerned that Iraq may use chemical weapons now that U.S. troops are inside the so-called "red line", the area where the U.S. military says Iraqi forces might be most likely to launch a poison-gas attack. \par \par \uc2  "I think the market is scaling back some of yesterday's euphoria," said a dealer at a Canadian bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers also said it was hard to predict how long a possible urban guerrilla war in Baghdad would take. \par \par \uc2  A Reuters poll of defence and Middle East experts published on Wednesday showed they expected U.S.-led forces to gain control of Baghdad within four to eight weeks. \par \par \uc2  But news that a U.S. Army Black Hawk helicopter had been shot down by small arms fire in southern Iraq, killing seven and wounding four on board, also reminded the market of the stiff registance within Iraq. \par \par \uc2  As of 0220 GMT, the dollar was quoted at 118.68/71 yen , down a tad from 118.91/99 yen in late U.S. trade. But it was still well above the low of 117.60 hit on early Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Early losses on the euro were pared, leaving it at $1.077/4/49 , flat from late U.S. levels. But it was still nearly two cents below Wednesday's peak of $1.0960. \par \par \uc2  The single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was changing hands at 127.88/94 yen  versus 128.16 yen in late U.S. trade. \par \par \uc2  DRIVEN BY MOOD \par \par \uc2  Traders say uncertainty over the war is so great that few players are eager to make large bets in either direction. \par \par \uc2  "I think few dealers are trading out of solid conviction. They are relying on the mood," said Tomomasa Noguchi, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at Mitsubishi Corp. \par \par \uc2  "But dealers like us have to make money, so they just need to follow the market's mood." The greenback was aided against the yen by wariness over further yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Some traders suspect \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  might have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  from late Tuesday to Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa said on Wednesday the Japanese authorities were ready to back up verbal warnings against \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fluctuations with action. \par \par \uc2  Some traders were also worried about recent signs of a decline in the U.S. economy, even though economic fundamentals have taken a back seat in the market because of the war. \par \par \uc2  Thursday will see the release of U.S. data including weekly jobless claims and the Institute for Supply Management's (ISM) non-manufacturing index for March, a gauge of the health of the U.S. service sector. \par \par \uc2  Economists surveyed by Reuters expect that jobless claims rose to 410,000 last week from 402,000 a week earlier. \par \par \uc2  The ISM's non-manufacturing index for March is expected to slip to 52.3 from 53.9 in February. \par \par \uc2  In Europe, the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is holding a policy meeting, though most economists expect the bank to leave rates unchanged. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030403dz43005k7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
