\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  mulls yen  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  to help stocks-Nikkei. \b0\par\par\uc2 509 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 21:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NEW YORK, March 10 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's government and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  are mulling ways to stabilize the domestic stock market, including massive injections of liquidity and heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the yen. a Japanese newspaper said. \par \par \uc2  The influential Nihon Keizai (Nikkei) newspaper reported on Monday that the government and the Bank of Japan were prepared, if necessary, to provide liquidity well above the bank's current target level as the March 31 close of the fiscal year approaches. \par \par \uc2  The report, without citing sources, also said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  was considering the option of massive yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the tune of 1 trillion yen ($8.6 billion) a day. \par \par \uc2  The yen weakened modestly on the report, falling from around 116.50 yen per dollar to 116.99 yen per dollar. \par \par \uc2  Japan has been concerned that a firming yen would hurt its export-led economy, and therefore the stock market, and has been quietly engaging in yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since January to stem the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise. \par \par \uc2  Fears of imminent war with Iraq and tensions over North Korea's moves to reactivate its nuclear program have weighed on Japanese stock prices. \par \par \uc2  Japan's Nikkei stock index fell to as low as 7,975.36 on Monday, a new 20-year low, before closing off 1.25 percent at 8042.26. \par \par \uc2  Earlier on Monday, Japanese Prime Minister Junichiro Koizumi said the government would cooperate with the Bank of Japan to take appropriate measures on stock prices. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the Bank of Japan would also consider focusing yen-selling orders into single bursts of around 1 trillion yen, as they did in May of 2002, the newspaper said. \par \par \uc2  According to the Nikkei, there was a consensus that recent unannounced stealth \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have not been very effective in restraining yen gains and that a likely option was to announce yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to amplify their effects. \par \par \uc2  "We've heard rumors to this effect a number of times over the course of the last 12 years or so, where the Bank of Japan has attempted to manipulate the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  while the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  has attempted to engineer an economic recovery," said Micheal Woolfolk, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at Bank of New York. \par \par \uc2  "But it's a false notion that they could weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  enough to induce export growth," he said, adding he would wait for more evidence that Japan would actually take such steps. \par \par \uc2  The dollar has weakened some 13 percent against the yen since it peaked at 135 yen in January of 2002 as falling U.S. stock prices, a struggling U.S. economy and fears of war with Iraq have weighed on the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The newspaper said that the Financial Services Agency, Japan's top banking regulator, would bring forward to May the date when it outlines a new mechanism to allow banks to shore up their capital bases with injections of capital funds. \par \par \uc2  It did not say which date had originally been set. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030310dz3a013tf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
