\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 -2: Japan MOF Vigilant Against Excessive Moves \b0\par\par\uc2 433 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 07:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Trade thinned in the afternoon as players retreated to the sidelines to await a crucial report to the U.N. Security Council by U.N. chief weapons inspector Hans Blix as well as U.S. payrolls data later Friday. \par \par \uc2  Trading in the yen was especially dull, as repeated stealth yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's finance ministry have sapped volatility from the market, a Japanese bank trader said. \par \par \uc2  While the ministry has declined to comment on whether it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in markets this week, as some suspect, it admitted last Friday that it had quietly sold yen several times for dollars and euros in late February. They have also admitted to a series of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in January. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar/yen's no longer in the limelight...(and) the Tokyo market's dead right now," Kokusai's Shioiri said. \par \par \uc2  A senior Finance Ministry official effectively welcomed the slower pace of trading, as he told reporters late Thursday the goal of the ministry's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are to curb excessive fluctuations in the dollar/yen exchange rate so as not to harm real-demand-backed trades made by Japanese institutional investors who need to exchange \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  for business purposes. \par \par \uc2  "If lack of volatility is driving away those who don't like that lack of volatility because they can't turn a quick profit, then that's fine," the senior ministry official said. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa, made clear again Friday that Japan remains vigilant against excessive moves, saying his ministry will watch the market carefully in the aftermath of the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's interest rate cut overnight. \par \par \uc2  "We plan to watch \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate moves today and tomorrow," Shiokawa told reporters, saying also that he welcomed the move by the ECB to coordinate its policies with those of Japan. \par \par \uc2  "Japan needs to glare at both the euro and the dollar," with regard to the yen, Shiokawa said. \par \par \uc2  Tokyo traders expect the dollar to trade quietly next week between Y116-Y119. \par \par \uc2  In late Tokyo, sterling was at $1.6015, little changed from $1.6018 in New York but higher than $1.6005 in Tokyo Thursday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   -By Miyako Takebe, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929;\par miyako.takebe@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The chart of late Tokyo \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates that accompanied Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has\par been replaced with an enhanced \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fixture that is updated\par hourly.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Subscribers can find this table:\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Telerate pages 4046 and 1087.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Dow Jones Newswires by searching the code N/IFX\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Reuters by entering FRX or INT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Bloomberg by entering NI FRX\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030307dz37000bz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
