\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  reserves set new record after  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 324 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 03:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, March 7 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's external reserves, already the world's largest, set a fresh record high for a third straight month in February after its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stem the yen's rise, data showed on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Selling of yen for the dollar and euro helped push Japan's reserves up to $485.265 billion by the end of February, compared with $478.593 billion in January, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  "The main reason behind the rise was our \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in February," a senior ministry official told a news conference. \par \par \uc2  The ministry disclosed on Friday last week that it had conducted covert \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times in February, buying dollars and euros to stem the yen's rise, which Japanese officials fear could hurt exports. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came as the dollar slipped to around 117 yen in late February - its lowest level in about six months - from near 122 yen in mid-February as fears mounted of U.S.-led invasion in Iraq. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is vulnerable to a war due to the costs of waging a conflict that would have to be borne by the United States, the impact on the U.S. economy, and a likely rise in oil prices. \par \par \uc2  "As we have said before, the size of our \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the month to February 26 was about 500 billion yen ($4.26 billion)," the official said. \par \par \uc2  The remainder of the increase came mainly from interest payments, the official said. \par \par \uc2  Japan's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves are by far the largest in the world, nearly twice as much as those of China, which holds the world's second-largest reserves of about $270 billion. \par \par \uc2  The dollar traded at around 117.40/42 yen on Friday, near its recent low of 116.85 yen, although wariness about Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was keeping dollar bears in check. ($1=117.32 Yen). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030307dz37004sj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
