\par\par \b \uc2  ANALYSIS-Japan  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  actions to lose impact, shrink market. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mariko Hayashibara \par \uc2 712 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 09:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, March 4 (Reuters) - The recent shift in the way \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will quickly lose its effectiveness and, to add to the authorities' displeasure, could undermine the importance of the Tokyo market, analysts say. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) used to confirm immediately that it had stepped into the market and the amounts involved usually resulted in sharp moves in rates and a jump in volume. \par \par \uc2  But this year, under new Vice Finance Minister for International Affairs Zembei Mizoguchi, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  discreetly - so discreetly that traders have sometimes hardly noticed it was there. \par \par \uc2  "For the first few times, 'stealth \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' may be effective as it is quite a surprise," said Koichi Ono, an economist at Daiwa Institute of Research. \par \par \uc2  "But the effect is most likely to wane if Japan continues to do the same thing every month," he said. \par \par \uc2  Under this stealth \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) secretly leaves bids at certain levels. Previously it used to step in aggressively to buy or sell the yen, as required. \par \par \uc2  Last Friday, MOF confirmed that it had conducted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in February for the second straight month, buying dollars and euros for slightly more than 500 billion yen. \par \par \uc2  BOJ data showed Japan had spent about 513 billion yen (equivalent to $4.36 billion on Tuesday) in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in February compared with 678 billion yen in January. \par \par \uc2  Further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was detected on Tuesday, with MOF buying dollars for yen, market sources said. \par \par \uc2  Even so, the dollar stood at 117.56/61 yen  on Tuesday afternoon, down from around 118.20 yen on Monday in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the greenback had dropped to 116.85 yen, its lowest level in nearly six months, on nervousness over a looming war in Iraq and signs of weakness in the U.S. economy. \par \par \uc2  That was down about four percent from this year's high of 121.78 yen hit about two weeks ago. \par \par \uc2  Japanese officials are \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  because they fear excessive yen strength could undermine exports, a pillar of the nation's faltering economic recovery. \par \par \uc2  One government source said Japan had no plans to revert to a policy of immediately confirming \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "(\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) acts in the same way as private market participants so that no one can tell that it's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the price movements," said the official. \par \par \uc2  "With this method of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , there is no need to announce that it's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Confirming it would lessen the impact of the message the authorities are trying to send to the market," he said. \par \par \uc2  SHRINKING MARKET \par \par \uc2  Analysts say one consequence of 'stealth \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' has been a reduction in volume and volatility in Tokyo's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, which reduces the stature of that market. \par \par \uc2  The Japanese authorities often say that they are \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  because market moves have been too rapid, so the falling away of speculative activity may please them on one level, especially as they have managed to hold the yen down to some extent. \par \par \uc2  "But in return, the Tokyo \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has become so inactive, with volatility and trade volume likely to fall further, which contradicts what the Japanese monetary authorities should be aiming to do," said Kaneo Ogino, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading at Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corp. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said trade volume usually shrinks after \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but after the recent stealth \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the shrinkage in volume seems to have been larger, perhaps because the market knows the BOJ will not go on bidding at higher levels. \par \par \uc2  Ogino and other analysts also said \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in overseas market as the dollar weakened of late on Iraq factors, which was further undermining volume in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  Spot trading volume on Monday was just $5.452 billion compared with average daily turnover of $8.929 billion in 2002. \par \par \uc2  One-month implied volatility was 9.6 percent versus around 10.5 percent in January before \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  started \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been selling its own \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since 1999 and the latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will increase Japanese external reserves, which were already at a record high of $478.593 billion at the end of January, more than twice as high as in January 1999. \par \par \uc2  ($1=117.60 yen). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030304dz3400g7n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
